<view class="promo-page">
  <view class="promo-intro">
    <text class="promo-kicker">商业化推广</text>
    <text class="promo-intro-desc">绑定抖音主页后，方可申请参与赛事赞助推广活动。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="promo-card">
    <view class="promo-card-head">
      <text class="promo-card-icon">🔗</text>
      <text class="promo-card-title">绑定状态</text>
    </view>
    <text class="promo-status {{anchorBindStatus === 'resolved' ? 'promo-status--ok' : ''}}">
      {{anchorBindStatusText}}<text wx:if="{{anchorName}}">（{{anchorName}}）</text>
    </text>
    <text wx:if="{{anchorPolling}}" class="promo-polling">雷达解析中，每 4 秒自动刷新…</text>
  </view>

  <view class="promo-card">
    <view class="promo-card-head">
      <text class="promo-card-icon">📋</text>
      <text class="promo-card-title">粘贴分享口令</text>
    </view>
    <text class="promo-p">打开抖音「我的 → 分享 → 复制链接」，将完整文本粘贴到下方。</text>
    <textarea
      class="promo-textarea"
      placeholder="长按复制此条消息… https://v.douyin.com/xxxx/ …"
      value="{{bindShareText}}"
      bindinput="onBindShareTextInput"
      maxlength="2000"
      auto-height
    />
    <button
      class="promo-btn-primary"
      type="primary"
      loading="{{bindSubmitting}}"
      disabled="{{bindSubmitting}}"
      bindtap="onBindProfileTap"
    >提交绑定</button>
    <text class="promo-tip">解析由雷达端完成，请勿在小程序内直接打开短链。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="promo-card promo-card--tip">
    <view class="promo-card-head">
      <text class="promo-card-icon">📣</text>
      <text class="promo-card-title">如何进入推广广场</text>
    </view>
    <text class="promo-p">由赛事中介分享小程序链接或小程序码进入，路径需带母比赛 ID，例如：</text>
    <text class="promo-path">packagePromo/pages/promo-square/promo-square?target_match_id=40</text>
    <text class="promo-tip">小程序码需在微信公众平台或由服务端接口生成，本应用内不提供扫码生成入口。</text>
  </view>
</view>
